OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order says no proposals on
OL,4,Atable to resolve Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe district master of the Orange Order
OL,7,Fin Portadown has said they were shown a
OL,8,Fdiscussion document in relation to the
OL,9,FDrumcree dispute, but stressed it was
OL,10,F"not a proposal".
OL,12,FBoth the Orange Order and the Garvaghy
OL,13,FRoad Residents' Coalition (GRRC) were
OL,14,Fgiven a document during separate
OL,15,Fmeetings with Secretary of State Sir
OL,16,FChris Bryant on Wednesday.
OL,18,FThe chairman of the residents'
OL,19,Fcoalition said his group would agree to
OL,20,Fit, if the Orange Order did.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
